# FLUX rows for the shared huggingface data table.
# Column conventions: https://docs.galaxyproject.org/en/latest/admin/data_tables.html
#
# Columns: value <TAB> name <TAB> pipeline_tag <TAB> domain <TAB> free_tag <TAB> version <TAB> path
#
#   value        : Hugging Face model ID; flux.py loads the model by this ID
#                  and only supports the IDs below
#   pipeline_tag : the model's tag on Hugging Face
#   domain       : image
#   free_tag     : flux
#   version      : the FLUX generation of the model (FLUX.2: 2, FLUX 3: 3).
#                  FLUX 2024+galaxy4 and older read only version 1, the FLUX.1
#                  rows with a models--* folder each; keep those while such a
#                  version is installed
#   path         : model root directory created by download_models.py
#                  (the directory that contains hub/); the tool sets HF_HOME to it
#
# Some models need a second model in the same root, which has no row;
# download_models.py downloads it with the model:
#   FLUX 3 Image Klein: its prompt upsampler,
#     black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup
#
# To configure:
# 1. Run download_models.py inside the tool's container (see the command at
#    the top of the script), with /data/db/flux_models mounted. Both
#    models need about 55 GB; --models downloads only one of them.
#    FLUX 3 Image Klein is gated: accept its terms on Hugging Face first
# 2. Copy the rows below, without the leading '#', to the huggingface.loc
#    you share with other tools, and replace /data/db/flux_models with that
#    directory. Leave out models you did not download. The rows are commented
#    out so that installing the tool from a Tool Shed does not add rows with
#    this placeholder path to the table
# 3. Keep value as the Hugging Face ID: the tool passes it to flux.py, so a
#    renamed value cannot be loaded
#
#black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B	FLUX.2 [klein] 4B (fast, generation, editing and inpainting)	image-to-image	image	flux	2	/data/db/flux_models
#black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein	FLUX 3 Image Klein (best quality, editing with up to 10 references, non-commercial)	image-to-image	image	flux	3	/data/db/flux_models
